{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26587","headline":"送杜立归蜀 · 姚合","name":"送杜立归蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢递三千里，西南是去程。\n杜陵家已尽，蜀国客重行。\n雪照巴江色，风吹栈阁声。\n马嘶山稍煖，人语店初明。\n旅梦心多感，孤吟气不平。\n谁爲李白後，爲访锦官城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}